        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Joey Slotnick, Ming-Na Wen, Ernest Borgnine, Brad Hall\n- Roles: Sam Sloan, Trudy, Manny\n- Products: The Single Guy, Watching Ellie, Saturday Night Live, Saturday Night News\n\nFacts:\n- Ming-Na Wen was born on November 20, 1963, and she is an American actress.\n- Brad Hall is best known as a \"Saturday Night Live\" news anchor on \"Saturday Night News.\"\n- Brad Hall created the sitcoms \"The Single Guy\" and \"Watching Ellie.\"\n- In \"The Single Guy,\" Joey Slotnick starred as Eliot's best friend Sam Sloan throughout the series' entire run.\n- In \"The Single Guy,\" Ming-Na Wen starred as Sam's wife Trudy throughout the series' entire run.\n- In \"The Single Guy,\" Ernest Borgnine starred as the doorman Manny throughout the series' entire run.",
